16.18. Double Arguments
16.18.1 sn2u
=\frac{2sn u\cdot cn u\cdot dn u}{1-msu^{4}u}=\frac{2sn u\cdot cn u\cdot dn u}{cn^{2}u+sn^{4}u\cdot dn^{3}u}
16.18.2 cn2u
=\frac{cn^{2}u-sn^{3}u\cdot dn^{2}u}{1-msu^{4}u}=\frac{cn^{4}u-sn^{4}u\cdot dn^{3}u}{cn^{2}u+sn^{2}u\cdot dn^{3}u}
16.18.3 dn2u
=\frac{dn^{3}u-ms^{4}v\cdot cn^{2}u}{1-msu^{4}u}=\frac{dn^{3}u+cn^{2}u(dn^{2}u-1)}{dn^{2}u-cn^{2}u(dn^{2}u-1)}
16.18.4   \frac{1-cn2u}{1+cn2u}=\frac{sn^{4}u\cdot dn^{3}u}{cn^{2}u}
16.18.5   \frac{1-dn2u}{1+dn2u}=\frac{msu^{2}u\cdot cn^{2}u}{dn^{2}u}
